          "docs": "Use this operation to generate booking transactions. This call is useful in the following two use cases:\n* During customer onboarding, there is a common scenario when customers perform data backfill or data fixes. To synchronize these changes from Billing to Revenue, use this API operation to regenerate booking transaction objects.\n* Customers choose to experiment with their use cases in the Sandbox environment before implementing them in the Production environment. During this experimentation p"
